{"script":"yd_025_02","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":165,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-272,"img":"chara025_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":165,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-272,"img":"chara025_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]嘿嘿……草原的环境可真不一样，周围有好多没见过的新东西！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]你问我会不会害怕陌生的环境？怎么会啦！[r]来到新地方虽然会有些不习惯，但比起探索新事物的喜悦来说，这根本不算什么！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]说起来……草原有什么特别好玩的东西吗？[r]比如会飞的野猪、金色的史莱姆、尾巴像水一样的小猫之类的？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]没有吗？那也没关系，至少我现在已经遇到很多有意思的事情了，比如……挥舞魔法锤子到处盖屋子的工匠！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":165,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-272,"img":"chara025_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"嘉莉缇-友善2"}